## 6. Live Regions — Dynamic Content Updates

When content changes in response to user interaction without a page navigation,
announce the change to screen readers using `aria-live`.

```jsx
// ✅ Step name updates when Back/Next is clicked
<span
  className="controls-step-name"
  aria-live="polite"
  aria-atomic="true"
>
  {steps[currentStep].label}
</span>
```

- Use `aria-live="polite"` for non-urgent updates (most cases)
- Use `aria-live="assertive"` only for errors or critical alerts
- Add `aria-atomic="true"` when the full string should be re-read on change

