## 14. Audit Checklist (run before marking any feature complete)

### Imports
- [ ] Every Carbon import uses the exact correct export name (see `.builder/rules/carbon-component-verification.mdc`)
- [ ] No unused imports remain in the file

### Semantics
- [ ] Page has one `<main>` landmark
- [ ] Heading levels are sequential (h1 → h2 → h3...), no skipped levels
- [ ] Tables use `<table>/<thead>/<tbody>/<th scope>/<td>`, not CSS-grid divs
- [ ] Forms have labels on every field

### ARIA
- [ ] Decorative images, icons, and chrome have `aria-hidden="true"`
- [ ] Meaningful icons have `aria-label` or adjacent `sr-only` text
- [ ] Dynamic regions that update have `aria-live="polite"` and `aria-atomic="true"`
- [ ] Custom progress/stepper uses `role="group"` + full `aria-label` (not `role="progressbar"` with per-step labels)
- [ ] Interactive regions have `role="region"` + `aria-label`

### Color / contrast
- [ ] No hardcoded hex colors — all colors use `var(--token-name)`
- [ ] Emoji or icon-only status indicators have `sr-only` text alternative

### Performance
- [ ] Static data arrays/objects are outside the component function
- [ ] Stable string keys used in all `.map()` calls

### Keyboard / focus
- [ ] All interactive elements reachable by Tab key
- [ ] Focus indicators visible in both light and dark themes
- [ ] No `<div onClick>` replacing a proper interactive element

### DevServer
- [ ] `DevServerLogs` shows no runtime errors after saving
- [ ] HMR update fires for every changed file (confirms Vite compiled successfully)
